<li><a href="#Bologna">Università degli Studi di Bologna</a></li>
<li><a href="#USF">Università degli Studi Firenze</a></li>
<li><a href="#Pisa">University of Pisa</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a id="Danza"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="57b71b68"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/7d6f16956e6647a18395ce55ffc03947/unnamed.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/7d6f16956e6647a18395ce55ffc03947/unnamed.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/7d6f16956e6647a18395ce55ffc03947/unnamed.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/7d6f16956e6647a18395ce55ffc03947/unnamed.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Accademia Nazionale di Danza</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.accademianazionaledanza.it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Accademia Nazionale di Danza (AND)</a> ligger på <a href="https://www.bing.com/maps?&amp;ty=18&amp;q=National%20Dance%20Academy&amp;ss=ypid.YN1354x9384284482960694612&amp;mb=41.8888~12.47209~41.879127~12.494148&amp;description=Roma%20%28Lazio%29%C2%B7Scuola%20di%20danza&amp;cardbg=%2388979C&amp;dt=1750068000000&amp;tt=National%20Dance%20Academy&amp;tsts0=%2526ty%253D18%2526q%253DNational%252520Dance%252520Academy%2526ss%253Dypid.YN1354x9384284482960694612%2526mb%253D41.8888~12.47209~41.879127~12.494148%2526description%253DRoma%252520%252528Lazio%252529%2525C2%2525B7Scuola%252520di%252520danza%2526cardbg%253D%25252388979C%2526dt%253D1750068000000&amp;tstt0=National%20Dance%20Academy&amp;cp=41.883736~12.479206&amp;lvl=16.797716&amp;pi=0&amp;ftst=0&amp;ftics=False&amp;v=2&amp;sV=2&amp;form=S00027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Aventinerhøyden i Roma</a>, omgitt av historiske bygninger. Institusjonen ble grunnlagt i 1940 av danseren og pedagogen Jia Ruskaja. Akademiet har en tydelig faglig profil med fokus på både klassisk og moderne dans, samt koreografi og dansepedagogikk.<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.accademianazionaledanza.it/storia/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Les mer</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.accademianazionaledanza.it/incoming/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Erasmus+ informasjon</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@accademianazionaledidanza6009" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Youtube kanal</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/accademianazionaledanza/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a></li>
</ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['57b71b68-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/7d6f16956e6647a18395ce55ffc03947/unnamed.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Accademia Nazionale di Danza","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.accademianazionaledanza.it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Accademia Nazionale di Danza (AND)</a> ligger p&aring; <a href=\"https://www.bing.com/maps?&amp;ty=18&amp;q=National%20Dance%20Academy&amp;ss=ypid.YN1354x9384284482960694612&amp;mb=41.8888~12.47209~41.879127~12.494148&amp;description=Roma%20%28Lazio%29%C2%B7Scuola%20di%20danza&amp;cardbg=%2388979C&amp;dt=1750068000000&amp;tt=National%20Dance%20Academy&amp;tsts0=%2526ty%253D18%2526q%253DNational%252520Dance%252520Academy%2526ss%253Dypid.YN1354x9384284482960694612%2526mb%253D41.8888~12.47209~41.879127~12.494148%2526description%253DRoma%252520%252528Lazio%252529%2525C2%2525B7Scuola%252520di%252520danza%2526cardbg%253D%25252388979C%2526dt%253D1750068000000&amp;tstt0=National%20Dance%20Academy&amp;cp=41.883736~12.479206&amp;lvl=16.797716&amp;pi=0&amp;ftst=0&amp;ftics=False&amp;v=2&amp;sV=2&amp;form=S00027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Aventinerh&oslash;yden i Roma</a>, omgitt av historiske bygninger. Institusjonen ble grunnlagt i 1940 av danseren og pedagogen Jia Ruskaja. Akademiet har en tydelig faglig profil med fokus p&aring; b&aring;de klassisk og moderne dans, samt koreografi og dansepedagogikk.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.accademianazionaledanza.it/storia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Les mer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.accademianazionaledanza.it/incoming/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Erasmus+ informasjon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@accademianazionaledidanza6009\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Youtube kanal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/accademianazionaledanza/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Instagram</a></li>\n</ul>"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="Arrigo"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="7411c255"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/c986821c05184d56a84f19d0e31b46e8/oip.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/c986821c05184d56a84f19d0e31b46e8/oip.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/c986821c05184d56a84f19d0e31b46e8/oip.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/c986821c05184d56a84f19d0e31b46e8/oip.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Conservatorio di Musica ”Arrigo Boito”</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.conservatorio.pr.it/en/home/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Conservatorio di Musica "Arrigo Boito"</a> ligger i <a href="https://www.bing.com/maps?&amp;ty=18&amp;q=Conservatorio%20Arrigo%20Boito%20Parma&amp;ss=ypid.YN1354x15365542442353104768&amp;mb=44.804376~10.313641~44.795156~10.335699&amp;description=Strada%20del%20Conservatorio%2027A%20-%2043121%20Parma%20%28Emilia-Romagna%29%C2%B7Scuola%20di%20musica&amp;cardbg=%2388979C&amp;dt=1750068000000&amp;tt=Conservatorio%20Arrigo%20Boito%20Parma&amp;tsts0=%2526ty%253D18%2526q%253DConservatorio%252520Arrigo%252520Boito%252520Parma%2526ss%253Dypid.YN1354x15365542442353104768%2526mb%253D44.804376~10.313641~44.795156~10.335699%2526description%253DStrada%252520del%252520Conservatorio%25252027A%252520-%25252043121%252520Parma%252520%252528Emilia-Romagna%252529%2525C2%2525B7Scuola%252520di%252520musica%2526cardbg%253D%25252388979C%2526dt%253D1750068000000&amp;tstt0=Conservatorio%20Arrigo%20Boito%20Parma&amp;cp=44.799124~10.325454&amp;lvl=16.998795&amp;pi=0&amp;ftst=0&amp;ftics=False&amp;v=2&amp;sV=2&amp;form=S00027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Parma, Italia</a>, og er et offentlig høyskole for musikkstudier. Undervisningsspråk er hovedsakelig italiensk, men mange individuelle timer kan gjennomføres på engelsk. Alle innreisende Erasmus-studenter får tilbus om gratis italienskkurs i samarbeid med universitetet i Parma.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.conservatorio.pr.it/en/incoming-students/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside innkommende studenter</a></li>
<li><a href="http://aule.conservatorio.pr.it/cgi-scripts/ordinamenti.exe?azione=corsi&amp;idordinamento=1&amp;idannoaccademico=5&amp;ordinamento=Triennio%20ord.%20/%20Bachelor%20degree%20(6th%20EQF%20level)&amp;annoaccademico=2018-2019" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Studier og emner</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@conservatorioarrigoboitopa5277/videos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Youtube-kanal</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved "Arrigo Boito" er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Vintersemesteret går fra oktober - februar&nbsp;<br>- Sommersemesteret går fra februar - juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['7411c255-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/c986821c05184d56a84f19d0e31b46e8/oip.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Conservatorio di Musica ”Arrigo Boito”","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.conservatorio.pr.it/en/home/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Conservatorio di Musica \"Arrigo Boito\"</a> ligger i <a href=\"https://www.bing.com/maps?&amp;ty=18&amp;q=Conservatorio%20Arrigo%20Boito%20Parma&amp;ss=ypid.YN1354x15365542442353104768&amp;mb=44.804376~10.313641~44.795156~10.335699&amp;description=Strada%20del%20Conservatorio%2027A%20-%2043121%20Parma%20%28Emilia-Romagna%29%C2%B7Scuola%20di%20musica&amp;cardbg=%2388979C&amp;dt=1750068000000&amp;tt=Conservatorio%20Arrigo%20Boito%20Parma&amp;tsts0=%2526ty%253D18%2526q%253DConservatorio%252520Arrigo%252520Boito%252520Parma%2526ss%253Dypid.YN1354x15365542442353104768%2526mb%253D44.804376~10.313641~44.795156~10.335699%2526description%253DStrada%252520del%252520Conservatorio%25252027A%252520-%25252043121%252520Parma%252520%252528Emilia-Romagna%252529%2525C2%2525B7Scuola%252520di%252520musica%2526cardbg%253D%25252388979C%2526dt%253D1750068000000&amp;tstt0=Conservatorio%20Arrigo%20Boito%20Parma&amp;cp=44.799124~10.325454&amp;lvl=16.998795&amp;pi=0&amp;ftst=0&amp;ftics=False&amp;v=2&amp;sV=2&amp;form=S00027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Parma, Italia</a>, og er et offentlig h&oslash;yskole for musikkstudier. Undervisningsspr&aring;k er hovedsakelig italiensk, men mange individuelle timer kan gjennomf&oslash;res p&aring; engelsk. Alle innreisende Erasmus-studenter f&aring;r tilbus om gratis italienskkurs i samarbeid med universitetet i Parma.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.conservatorio.pr.it/en/incoming-students/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside innkommende studenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://aule.conservatorio.pr.it/cgi-scripts/ordinamenti.exe?azione=corsi&amp;idordinamento=1&amp;idannoaccademico=5&amp;ordinamento=Triennio%20ord.%20/%20Bachelor%20degree%20(6th%20EQF%20level)&amp;annoaccademico=2018-2019\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Studier og emner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@conservatorioarrigoboitopa5277/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Youtube-kanal</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved \"Arrigo Boito\" er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- Vintersemesteret g&aring;r fra oktober - februar&nbsp;<br />- Sommersemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="CPM"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="c9108357"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/bc61c244e42b407090f1412f4482cac8/cpminstitutelogo_20181203100441.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/bc61c244e42b407090f1412f4482cac8/cpminstitutelogo_20181203100441.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/bc61c244e42b407090f1412f4482cac8/cpminstitutelogo_20181203100441.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/bc61c244e42b407090f1412f4482cac8/cpminstitutelogo_20181203100441.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">CPM Music Institute Milan</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.cpm.it/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CPM Music Institute</a> er et privat musikkuniversitet i Milano, Italia. Dette universitetet er perfekt for deg som vil utvide dine musikalske horisonter i hjertet av Milano. Undervisningen kombineres med forelesninger, workshops, øving på scene og i studio.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.cpm.it/en/chi-siamo/1/cpm-scuola-musica-milano" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CPM Music Institute infoside</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.cpm.it/en/chi-siamo/40/https-wwwcpmit-chi-siamo-9-progetto-erasmus" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Informasjon om Erasmus charter</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen hos CPM er som følger:<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra oktober - februar<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra mars - juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['c9108357-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/bc61c244e42b407090f1412f4482cac8/cpminstitutelogo_20181203100441.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"CPM Music Institute Milan","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.cpm.it/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CPM Music Institute</a> er et privat musikkuniversitet i Milano, Italia. Dette universitetet er perfekt for deg som vil utvide dine musikalske horisonter i hjertet av Milano. Undervisningen kombineres med forelesninger, workshops, &oslash;ving p&aring; scene og i studio.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cpm.it/en/chi-siamo/1/cpm-scuola-musica-milano\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CPM Music Institute infoside</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cpm.it/en/chi-siamo/40/https-wwwcpmit-chi-siamo-9-progetto-erasmus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Informasjon om Erasmus charter</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen hos CPM er som f&oslash;lger:<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra oktober - februar<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra mars - juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="IED"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="e39b9430"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/1eba12ed3ceb43fd84ac598e140804bc/ied-istituto-europeo-di-design.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/1eba12ed3ceb43fd84ac598e140804bc/ied-istituto-europeo-di-design.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/1eba12ed3ceb43fd84ac598e140804bc/ied-istituto-europeo-di-design.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/1eba12ed3ceb43fd84ac598e140804bc/ied-istituto-europeo-di-design.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">IED Instituto Europeo di Design</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.ied.edu/milan" target="_blank" rel="noopener">IED Instituto Europeo di Design</a> er en privat designskole beliggende i Milano, Italia. Grunnlagt i 1966 har universitetet opparbeidet seg et sterkt fokus på kreativitet i hjertet av en av Italies mest kulturrike byer.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.ied.edu/milan/design-school?_gl=1*1e96szi*_up*MQ..*_ga*NDE2MzYxMDM0LjE3MTQ0ODYyMzQ.*_ga_CZTTXF5D3M*MTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4xLjAuMTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4wLjAuMA.." target="_blank" rel="noopener">IED designskolens emneoversikt</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/1eba12ed3ceb43fd84ac598e140804bc/ied-fact-sheet-2026-27.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fact sheet 2026/2027</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ied.edu/about-us?_gl=1*1ato2lr*_up*MQ..*_ga*NDE2MzYxMDM0LjE3MTQ0ODYyMzQ.*_ga_CZTTXF5D3M*MTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4xLjEuMTcxNDQ4Njg2MC4wLjAuMA.." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside om universitetet</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ied.edu/students/international-mobility?_gl=1*1tvq7gm*_up*MQ..*_ga*NDE2MzYxMDM0LjE3MTQ0ODYyMzQ.*_ga_CZTTXF5D3M*MTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4xLjEuMTcxNDQ4NzMyNi4wLjAuMA.." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ied.edu/mission-e-vision?_gl=1*bij3xw*_up*MQ..*_ga*NDE2MzYxMDM0LjE3MTQ0ODYyMzQ.*_ga_CZTTXF5D3M*MTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4xLjEuMTcxNDQ4Njk5OC4wLjAuMA.." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Universitetets 'core values'</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AiMU2TGkA40" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Presentasjonsvideo</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved universitetet er som følger<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra september/oktober - februar/mars<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar/mars - juli</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['e39b9430-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/1eba12ed3ceb43fd84ac598e140804bc/ied-istituto-europeo-di-design.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"IED Instituto Europeo di Design","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.ied.edu/milan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IED Instituto Europeo di Design</a> er en privat designskole beliggende i Milano, Italia. Grunnlagt i 1966 har universitetet opparbeidet seg et sterkt fokus p&aring; kreativitet i hjertet av en av Italies mest kulturrike byer.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ied.edu/milan/design-school?_gl=1*1e96szi*_up*MQ..*_ga*NDE2MzYxMDM0LjE3MTQ0ODYyMzQ.*_ga_CZTTXF5D3M*MTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4xLjAuMTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4wLjAuMA..\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IED designskolens emneoversikt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/1eba12ed3ceb43fd84ac598e140804bc/ied-fact-sheet-2026-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact sheet 2026/2027</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ied.edu/about-us?_gl=1*1ato2lr*_up*MQ..*_ga*NDE2MzYxMDM0LjE3MTQ0ODYyMzQ.*_ga_CZTTXF5D3M*MTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4xLjEuMTcxNDQ4Njg2MC4wLjAuMA..\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside om universitetet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ied.edu/students/international-mobility?_gl=1*1tvq7gm*_up*MQ..*_ga*NDE2MzYxMDM0LjE3MTQ0ODYyMzQ.*_ga_CZTTXF5D3M*MTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4xLjEuMTcxNDQ4NzMyNi4wLjAuMA..\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ied.edu/mission-e-vision?_gl=1*bij3xw*_up*MQ..*_ga*NDE2MzYxMDM0LjE3MTQ0ODYyMzQ.*_ga_CZTTXF5D3M*MTcxNDQ4NjIzMS4xLjEuMTcxNDQ4Njk5OC4wLjAuMA..\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Universitetets 'core values'</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AiMU2TGkA40\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Presentasjonsvideo</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved universitetet er som f&oslash;lger<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra september/oktober - februar/mars<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar/mars - juli"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p>&nbsp;<a id="NABA"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="b1de5651"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/fd503a7ec76244f486fa5124f9a0016a/naba.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/fd503a7ec76244f486fa5124f9a0016a/naba.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/fd503a7ec76244f486fa5124f9a0016a/naba.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/fd503a7ec76244f486fa5124f9a0016a/naba.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Nuova Accademia di Belle Arti</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.naba.it/en">NABA, Nuova Accademia di Belle Arti</a> er et privat kunst- og designakademi i Milano. Merk at høst-/vintersemesteret kan vare til og med 1. mars. Man må derfor være forberedt på å ta emner parallelt på NABA og Kristiania.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="/contentassets/344d52fca4dd4533a61cc9f55f1f8431/erasmus_brochure-2025-26.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Brosjyre om "Erasmus+ and International Exchange"</a></li>
